	:TPCJ
	script_name 'TPCJ'

	// * ... Menu Code (create our menu etc) ...

	:TPCJ_744
	if
	  2@ == 7
	goto_if_false @TPCJ_782
	Actor.PutAt($PLAYER_ACTOR, 2026.0, 1008.0, 10.0)           // The Four Dragons Casino - set manually, n0t variables.
-- /code --

//------------------------------------
// ---- Teleport To Player Target ----
//------------------------------------
Info:		Teleport To Player Target (Red Marker)
Credits:		https://gtaforums.com/topic/1005521-gtasa-ps2pcsx2-spawn-any-vehicle-teleport-system-cheat-app-exe/#elControls_1072658836_menu
Notes:		206FF970 | 206B20F0

// ---- Menu Options ----
206FFA70 = red marker 	| (counter) e.g. 0008|002E - Marker number 8, Showing. || 0001|0000 = marker 1 is off.
206FFAB0 = Zoom 			| Out = decrease		| In = Increase

Coordinates of Grid Cross Indicator NOT Player Target
206FFAB4 = some coords 	| Left = Increase value	| Right = Decrease value
206FFAB8 = some coords 	| Up = Increase Value	| Down = Decrease Value
206FFABC = X coords 		| Left = Decrease value  | Right = Increase value
206FFAC0 = Y coords 		| Up = Increase Value	| Down = Decrease Value

IF 206FFA70 == 2E(hex) - 46(dec) | Player Target is Showing
readBytes @ grid reference X/Y coords
set coords X,Y
Guess Z coords. and set no fall damage or inf health ?  MapEditro show units for static mesh tallest building to get z axis ?

{code}
PT = readBytes(0x206FFA70)
On=2E
Off=00
print(PT)

if PT == On then
	writeFloat(0x206E1F1B, X_coords)
	writeFloat(0x206E1F20, Y_coords)
	writeFloat(0x206E1F25, Z_coords)
	print(--open Main.scm Teleport Cheat menu (Select+L1) choose Option 7)
end

