// --------------------------------------------
// ---- Vehicles (Spawn) ----
// --------------------------------------------

IMPORTANT:
	Users can change the (counter) address to one of the "STATS" addresses or a blank memory address.
	Counter Currently uses "//Number of Times Cheated: 208023F4" address
	'UNUSED' STATS may exist: e.g. 20802308 - ** NOT TESTED **

Issues:
	No more can be added. Example: Simply adding a second counter for decrement ID breaks everything
	This may be a limitation of pcsx 1.6.0, ... and if ported to 2.6.0+ it might work if it supports multiple functions.

---- "GTSA-Cheats.exe (Companion App)" ----
FIX;- (ID not updating for spawn vehicle cheat in the companion app).
	* This is normal emulator behaviour, Save & load state for changes to update. Quick Save & Reload (F1, F3).
	But we can fix this for the entire game session by using the ".pnach" patches

  * IF using the app you must execute these (3) patches once...
  * Boot Game -> Enable ".pnach" Cheats -> Run Companion app .exe
  * Execute (1): Press & hold R1 to increment VH ID +1, once - (Hold R1 until counter hits 60 and VH ID updates by +1).
  * Execute (2): Press R1 + R2 to activate, once
  * Execute (3): and use the L1 + L2 to deactivate, once.
  * After using the codes 1 time Companion app buttons will work.

---- "MAGIC_CAR" ----
